  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SOM: Somalia Stability Fund Phase 3 (SSF3)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi Donor Trust Fund designed to support political settlement at national and state levels in Somalia through key contributions across 5 &quot;workstreams&quot;: 1: Political settlement, 2: Conciliation, 3: Local Governance and Democratization, 4: social contract, 5: Research.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">That politics and intercommunal contention in Somalia will unfold in a more formally rule based, inclusive and non-violent manner.</narrative>
  </description>
